[[8163,3117,"The GMP Force Duty Supervisor assumed that the NWMPG Supervisor had taken Command and Control when they had not done so","lack of clear command and control during pursuit",""],[8164,3117,"The NWPGM Supervisor did not communicate whether they had taken Command and Control clearly","unclear communication of command responsibility",""],[8165,3117,"The GMP Force Duty Supervisor did not consider that they had any authority to perform Command and Control of the pursuit once it had entered the motorway network","unauthorised pursuit command on motorway",""],[8166,3117,"The Protocol did not operate in practice so that there was no effective Command and Control at any point during the pursuit","protocol failure in command and control",""]]